WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
BUILD 070. LEGALIZATION IS A LIFECYCLE, NOT A VOTE. A fictional vote opens a long regulatory record. It does not prove implementation, access, equity, safety, effectiveness, legitimacy, or completion.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
UNFOLD THE SYSTEM. ONE VOTE. EIGHT ACCOUNTABLE STAGES.. Follow advocacy, enactment, rulemaking, licensing, operations and enforcement, litigation, evaluation, and revision.

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
KEEP EVIDENCE ATTACHED. SOURCE · STATE · BLOCKER · UNKNOWN. Every milestone carries its own fictional evidence, verification state, blockers, alert, claim boundary, and later change.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
PRESERVE CONTEST. ENFORCEMENT AND LITIGATION REMAIN OPEN. A passed measure can still encounter disputed rules, blocked operations, contested enforcement, litigation, and revision obligations.

5
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
BOUND THE RESULT. A LIFECYCLE RECORD IS NOT CURRENT LAW. This fictional tracker provides no legal advice, authority, compliance, prediction, access, safety, equity, effectiveness, or implementation determination.

6
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
SAVE THIS. FOLLOW THE WHOLE SYSTEM. REGULATORY INTELLIGENCE BEGINS WHEN ADVOCACY, ENACTMENT, DELIVERY, EVIDENCE, CONTEST, EVALUATION, REVISION, AND UNKNOWN STATE STAY CONNECTED.

